{"id":"n46803-1-7","stage":3,"title":"두어 · 两三","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n46803-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 고등어는 몇 마리나 사 올까요?","zh":"妈妈，鲭鱼买几条？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고등어는","meaning":"青花鱼，鲭鱼，鲐鱼","explanation":"고등어：青花鱼，鲭鱼，鲐鱼；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"고등어","audio":"/audio/f27dcdaf2369686a4a06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23373","senseId":"1","lemma":"고등어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마리나","meaning":"只，头，条","explanation":"마리：只，头，条；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51771","senseId":"1","lemma":"마리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올까요?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"f27dcdaf2369686a","term":"고등어","zh":"青花鱼，鲭鱼，鲐鱼","audio":"/audio/f27dcdaf2369686a4a06.mp3","entryId":"23373","definition":"一种海鱼，背部呈青色，有黑色波纹，腹部呈白色，肉多。","pronunciation":["고등어"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"1338676ef4cf144f","term":"마리","zh":"只，头，条","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3","entryId":"51771","definition":"计算飞禽走兽或鱼虫等的数量单位。","pronunciation":["마리"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1191a6c637f95bf2463.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n46803-1-7-2","ko":"가족들이 먹게 두어 마리 사 오렴.","zh":"买两三条回来给家里人吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족들이","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹게","meaning":"怀，打主意，投","explanation":"먹다：怀，打主意，投；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"5","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두어","meaning":"两三","explanation":"두어：两三","readings":[{"term":"두어","audio":"/audio/ef468dd2264d91918177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46803","senseId":"1","lemma":"두어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마리","meaning":"只，头，条","explanation":"마리：只，头，条","readings":[{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51771","senseId":"1","lemma":"마리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오렴.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"怀，打主意，投","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"抱有某种心意或感情。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"ef468dd2264d9191","term":"두어","zh":"两三","audio":"/audio/ef468dd2264d91918177.mp3","entryId":"46803","definition":"两个左右的。","pronunciation":["두어"]},{"id":"1338676ef4cf144f","term":"마리","zh":"只，头，条","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3","entryId":"51771","definition":"计算飞禽走兽或鱼虫等的数量单位。","pronunciation":["마리"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/75709378bd2f26569fa0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.776,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=46803","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.6027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["买两三条回来给家里人吃。","妈妈，鲭鱼买几条？","承奎从美国回来啦？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，鲭鱼买几条？","承奎从美国回来啦？","买两三条回来给家里人吃。"],"answer":2}]}
